  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&apos;&apos;Support to Private Sector Development and Job creation in Rwanda&apos;&apos;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to enhance inclusive and sustainable economic growth for youth employment and expansion of the private sector.With specific objctives to strengthen market-oriented skills of youth for the Tourism and Hospitality sector in Rwanda and to increase digital-based opportunities in high potential sectors in 4 of the secondary cities in Rwanda.</narrative>
  </description>
